{"v":4,"catch":"基於80年代經典射擊遊戲的2D Shoot'Em Up","desc":"泰拉轟炸機是基於1980年代經典射擊遊戲的二維側面滾動條。\n\n在十個越來越困難的地形上駕駛您的船，只用一個目標就可以避免武器，火箭和惡棍的各種位置； 摧毀基地和關卡的盡頭。\n\n為了幫助進攻和防禦，玩家擁有武器和炸彈，可以通過收集能量道具來增加力量。\n\n玩家還必須觀察他們的燃油水平，並通過破壞油箱來保持燃油水平。","publisher":"Funbox Media","release":"2021-07-29","genres":["街機","射擊"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/51967688bc622cc17ee59851158699554f441ef11fe7693dfef5e4c4760eb5e4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9ba9a95cc73ed93cadd15e17337ba1a21ee57211fc8b3683b53694e89c879dcb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/95e94206f1b7e260d44b1f6028a4821805a25b056fd03e00a3738cfd3cafb210.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8efba4c03e13168a011d188aca884e50f921875654d61a3885f58f393a5c0388.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c0eb43fc926c2d992c785f42906d8b590f13b4bb109ba840a1a3597fcc0340c3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0f81c9b9af351f0f9f7da7bcd8aabedbd1b8d77f5327001572fb94dcdd8518af.jpg"],"titleId":"01003990145ee000","dlc":[]}